ACCURACY
--------

This map is the result of reverse engineering, not vendor documentation. Every
entry carries an explicit confidence level (A–D) and the evidence behind it;
see the "Confidence levels" table in `README.md`. Entries below level A may be
wrong. Nothing here is warranted as correct or complete.

